### Redis répond
GET http://localhost:8080/api/redis/ping

### Enregistrer une session pour 30 minutes
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/redis/sessions/demo-token?studentId=42&ttlSeconds=1800

### Lire la session
GET http://localhost:8080/api/redis/sessions/demo-token

### Supprimer la session
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/redis/sessions/demo-token

### Enregistrer un profil JSON
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/redis/students/42
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 42,
  "name": "Ada",
  "email": "ada@example.test",
  "city": "Paris",
  "version": 1
}

### Lire le profil
GET http://localhost:8080/api/redis/students/42

### Ajouter un participant
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/redis/courses/redis/participants/42

### Lister les participants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/redis/courses/redis/participants

### Augmenter un score
POST http://localhost:8080/api/redis/courses/redis/scores/42?delta=12

### Lire le classement
GET http://localhost:8080/api/redis/courses/redis/ranking

